      "label": "Friday 2026-05-15 \u2014 Day 1",
      "notes": "- Depart Ajax in the morning (~5h drive to George Lake access)\n- Permit pickup at George Lake park office\n- Launch from George Lake\n- Portage / paddle into Killarney Lake then north to OSA Lake\n- Camp: site 61, OSA Lake"
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-05-16",
      "label": "Saturday 2026-05-16 \u2014 Day 2",
      "notes": "- Pack up, paddle south back through Killarney Lake\n- Three Narrows portage into Baie Fine\n- Camp: site 82, Baie Fine"
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-05-17",
      "label": "Sunday 2026-05-17 \u2014 Day 3",
      "notes": "- Pack up, paddle / portage back into Killarney Lake\n- Camp: site 12, Killarney Lake"
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-05-18",
      "label": "Monday 2026-05-18 \u2014 Day 4",
      "notes": "- Pack up, paddle out to George Lake access\n- Drive home to Ajax"
